  <section class="section split-grid">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Dipendra Pradhan makes photographs, writes stories, and keeps notes on the textures of everyday life. This site is a living archive for that attention: quiet images, reflective writing, fragments from walks, and pieces that may grow over time.</p>
      <p>His creative interests move between visuals and writing, between the seen and the remembered. A Fujifilm X-S10 often comes along for the walk.</p>
    </div>
